KEHTAY HAIN ROOKAY SARWAR, AAWAZ DO AYE AKBAR <br>
AATA HUNN RANKO BETA, KHATAY HUWAY MAI THOOKAR<br>
<br>
1. JAAKAR MAI KYA KAHOONGA LAILA SE YE BATADO AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 HAI MUNTAZIR TUMHARI QAIMAY KE DAR PA MADAR<br>
<br>
2. GURBAT ME TERA LAASHA KAISE UTHAOUN TANHA AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 THAMAY HUWAY KAMAR KO YE KAH RAHE HAI SARWAR<br>
<br>
3. LAILA KI HAI TAMANNA ZAINAB KI AARZO HAI AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 LAYE DULHAN WO EK DIN AKBAR TERI BIYAH KAR<br>
<br>
4. AKBAR TERI JUDAI SUGRA NA SEH SAKEGI AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 TAA UMR TERE GHAM ME TADPEGI TERI KHWAHAR.<br>
<br>
5. MAQTAL KI SAR ZAMEEN YE RO RO KE KEH RAHI HAI. AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 SOOTI HAI NOUJAWANI BARCHI JIGAR PA KHAKAR.<br>
<br>
6. GHAZI KE GHAM SE PAHLE TOOTI MERI KAMAR HAI AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 BETA TUMHARE GHAM SE DIL MAY BAPA HAI MEHSHAR<br>
<br>
7. KADYAL JAWAN KA SAR THA HUMRAHA HUMSAFAR MAY AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 AHLE HARAM KE DIL PAR YUNN CHALRAHA THA QANJAR<br>
<br>
8. KOI NAHI THA JOUHER NUSRAT KO SHAI KI JISDAM AKBAR HAYE AKBAR<br>
 SUNKAR SADAYE HALMINN JHOOLE SE AAYE ASGHER<br>
